Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:01.95,TL,,0,0,0,,为什么{\fs78}39{\fs68}岁的德约
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.95,0:00:04.87,TL,,0,0,0,,连续{\fs78}21{\fs68}个赛季都能夺冠？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.16,0:00:10.54,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But it is a seventh Beijing title for Novak Djokovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是德约科维奇的第七个北京冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.77,0:00:13.38,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}6{\fs68}日北京 第一盘{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.38,0:00:15.94,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}第二盘开局后德米纳尔退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:19.03,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}{\fs78}ATP{\fs68}说 公开赛年代 他是第一个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.03,0:00:20.51,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}连续{\fs78}21{\fs68}个赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.51,0:00:22.45,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}都有巡回赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.45,0:00:24.42,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}这是第{\fs78}102{\fs68}个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.42,0:00:28.24,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}费德勒{\fs78}103{\fs68} 康纳斯{\fs78}109{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.79,0:00:32.09,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2006{\fs68}年阿默斯福特 他{\fs78}19{\fs68}岁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.09,0:00:34.99,TL,,0,0,0,,对面是马苏 {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.99,0:00:38.56,TL,,0,0,0,,网前这一抱 是第一个巡回赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.79,0:00:43.79,TL,,0,0,0,,他把荷兰公开赛的冠军收下了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.89,0:00:48.62,TL,,0,0,0,,蒙特利尔决赛 对面是费德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.62,0:00:51.00,TL,,0,0,0,,第一盘{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 第二盘{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:53.35,TL,,0,0,0,,第三盘又是{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.94,0:01:02.94,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's done it, what a way to do so.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他拿下了 就这么拿下的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.14,0:01:05.99,TL,,0,0,0,,这座奖杯是蒙特利尔的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.64,0:01:13.19,TL,,0,0,0,,年终总决赛 {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.19,0:01:15.27,TL,,0,0,0,,对面是达维登科
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.99,0:01:18.93,TL,,0,0,0,,他把奖杯举起来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.79,0:01:28.22,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2009{\fs68}年巴塞尔决赛 对面是费德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.22,0:01:29.75,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} {\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.75,0:01:32.23,TL,,0,0,0,,这一分过去就是{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.84,0:01:39.72,TL,,0,0,0,,北京决赛的赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.72,0:01:43.12,TL,,0,0,0,,对面是费雷尔 {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.24,0:01:51.34,TL,,0,0,0,,澳网决赛的冠军点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.34,0:01:55.31,TL,,0,0,0,,对面是穆雷 {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.94,0:02:06.30,TL,,0,0,0,,澳网决赛{\fs78}5{\fs68}盘 对面是纳达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.99,0:02:09.63,TL,,0,0,0,,又是澳网决赛 冠军点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.63,0:02:11.17,TL,,0,0,0,,对面还是穆雷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.17,0:02:15.08,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.49,0:02:23.26,TL,,0,0,0,,印第安维尔斯 对面是费德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.26,0:02:24.90,TL,,0,0,0,,第一盘{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.90,0:02:27.62,TL,,0,0,0,,抢七里 他{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.92,0:02:32.64,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Congratulations to Djokovic as he returns to the winner's circle once more.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N恭喜德约科维奇 他又拿到冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.79,0:02:36.24,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2015{\fs68}年年终总决赛 对面是费德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.24,0:02:38.55,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.49,0:02:44.95,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2016{\fs68}年法网
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.95,0:02:47.38,TL,,0,0,0,,他把冠军杯举过头顶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.97,0:02:59.16,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ladies and gentlemen, your Qatar ExxonMobil Open 2017 champion, Novak Djokovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N卡塔尔公开赛冠军 德约科维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.44,0:03:00.98,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}温网时右肘伤了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.98,0:03:04.09,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}那个赛季就此停了 美网没能去打
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.09,0:03:06.65,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}手术是下一年澳网之后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.65,0:03:09.73,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}多哈的冠军 还在这之前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.28,0:03:13.20,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2018{\fs68}年温网 对面是安德森
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.20,0:03:14.72,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.72,0:03:16.88,TL,,0,0,0,,这一分是冠军点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.88,0:03:25.51,TL,,0,0,0,,温网决赛 对面是费德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.51,0:03:28.25,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}12{\fs68}平 这一分是赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.88,0:03:44.18,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2020{\fs68}年澳网决赛 对面是蒂姆
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.18,0:03:48.03,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 这一分过去就是{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.88,0:04:02.14,TL,,0,0,0,,法网的男单冠军杯 在他手里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.38,0:04:18.85,TL,,0,0,0,,温网决赛的赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.85,0:04:20.76,TL,,0,0,0,,对面是克耶高斯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.76,0:04:22.71,TL,,0,0,0,,这场还没结束
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.08,0:04:29.07,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2023{\fs68}年年终总决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.07,0:04:31.05,TL,,0,0,0,,奖杯又回到他手里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.05,0:04:33.92,TL,,0,0,0,,这座冠军 他拿过{\fs78}7{\fs68}次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.68,0:04:47.21,TL,,0,0,0,,抢七还在打 对面是阿尔卡拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.91,0:04:55.22,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}In his fifth Olympic Games, Novak Djokovic finally gets what he wanted.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第五次奥运 他终于得到了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.06,0:04:56.84,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Olympic gold.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N奥运金牌
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.08,0:05:00.65,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}37{\fs68}岁 心 灵魂 身体 家人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.65,0:05:02.26,TL,,0,0,0,,都押上了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.33,0:05:05.81,TL,,0,0,0,,雅典 对面是穆塞蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.81,0:05:08.94,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.88,0:05:14.88,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a fabulous match.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这场球太漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.08,0:05:17.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The first time in nine meetings.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N九次交手 这是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.03,0:05:21.46,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}下一个赛季 你等他再添一座吗？
